Package: meg
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, golang
Section: recon
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/tomnomnom/meg
Description: Fetch many paths for many hosts - without killing the hosts
 meg is a Go tool for fetching many paths for many hosts in parallel.
 It can check a large list of hosts against a large wordlist of paths
 without flooding the targets.
